        "text": "<p>Say hello to your new best friend, Muse.</p><p>It’s the smart headband that guides you through meditations by detecting if your mind is calm or wandering and giving you audio cues to help you focus. Muse acts as your real time meditation coach. Its advanced EEG sensors can detect when your mind wanders and give you gentle audio cues to bring your focus back to the present. Helping you ignore distractions and achieve deeper levels of concentration and focus when meditating than ever before.</p><p>Muse senses when your mind begins to wander and plays gentle storm sounds through your headphones to help bring your focus back to the present moment.</p>",
